{"speciesId":552,"names":{"fr":"Escroco","es":"Krokorok","en":"Krokorok","ja":"ワルビル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ils vivent en petits groupes. La membrane qui couvre leurs yeux les protège du soleil."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"They live in groups of a few individuals. Protective membranes shield their eyes from sandstorms."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"La membrane spéciale qui recouvre ses yeux détecte la chaleur et lui permet de voir dans le noir."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The special membrane covering its eyes can sense the heat of objects, so it can see its surroundings even in darkness."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Protected by thin membranes, their eyes can see even in the dead of night. They live in groups of a few individuals."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Protected by thin membranes, their eyes can see even in the dead of night. They live in groups of a few individuals."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ils vivent en petits groupes. La membrane qui couvre leurs yeux les protège du soleil."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Viven en manadas. La membrana que cubre sus ojos los protege de la arena."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"They live in groups of a few individuals. Protective membranes shield their eyes from sandstorms."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"数匹で 群れを 作る。 眼球を カバーする 膜が 砂嵐から 目を 守る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"La membrane spéciale qui recouvre ses yeux détecte la chaleur et lui permet de voir dans le noir."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Una membrana especial cubre sus ojos y le permite detectar el calor de los cuerpos, por eso ve en la oscuridad."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The special membrane covering its eyes can sense the heat of objects, so it can see its surroundings even in darkness."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"眼球を 覆う 特殊な 膜が 物体の 熱を 感知するため 暗闇でも まわりが 見えるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ils vivent en petits groupes. La membrane qui couvre leurs yeux les protège du soleil."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Viven en manadas. La membrana que cubre sus ojos los protege de la arena."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"They live in groups of a few individuals. Protective membranes shield their eyes from sandstorms."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"数匹で 群れを 作る。 眼球を カバーする 膜が 砂嵐から 目を 守る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"La membrane spéciale qui recouvre ses yeux détecte la chaleur et lui permet de voir dans le noir."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Una membrana especial cubre sus ojos y le permite detectar el calor de los cuerpos, por eso ve en la oscuridad."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The special membrane covering its eyes can sense the heat of objects, so it can see its surroundings even in darkness."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"眼球を 覆う 特殊な 膜が 物体の 熱を 感知するため 暗闇でも まわりが 見えるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Les Escroco se déplacent en bandes, souvent menées par une femelle. La plupart du temps, les mâles se chargent de collecter la nourriture."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Viven en manadas. En muchos casos, las hembras ejercen una posición dominante y los machos se encargan de buscar alimento."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"They move in groups of a few individuals. A female is often the leader of the group, and the males will gather food."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"数匹の 群れを 成して 行動。 群れの 中心は ♀の 場合が 多く ♂たちが 餌を 集める。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Grâce à la membrane spéciale qui recouvre ses yeux, il peut distinguer parfaitement ses environs, même en pleine nuit."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"La membrana especial que le recubre los ojos le permite discernir con claridad lo que se halla a su alrededor, incluso en plena noche."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Thanks to the special membrane covering its eyes, it can see its surroundings clearly, even in the middle of the night."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"目を 覆う 特殊な 膜の おかげで 真夜中でも あたりを はっきり 見ることが できるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Son corps supportant mal les baisses de température, il s’ensable profondément lorsque les nuits sont trop fraîches."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Su gran debilidad es el frío, por lo que cuando bajan las temperaturas de noche en el desierto, excava un agujero en la arena y se cobija en él."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Krokorok really hates it when its body gets cold. On nights when the temperature drops, it digs deep into the desert sands."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"体が 冷えるのが とても 苦手。 気温が 下がる 晩には 砂漠の 砂の 奥深くに 潜っている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il garde une partie de ses prises en réserve dans le sable, au cas où il rentrerait bredouille de la chasse."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Entierra parte de sus presas bajo la arena para reservarlas a modo de víveres de emergencia, en caso de una caza infructuosa."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"It buries some of its prey in the sand to use as emergency meals when its hunts are unsuccessful."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"獲物の １部は 砂の中に 埋めて 狩りが 失敗したときの 非常食に するのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il chasse de nuit sans difficulté grâce à ses yeux particuliers qui lui permettent de voir dans l’obscurité."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Es capaz de cazar en plena noche sin perderse gracias a sus ojos especiales, que le permiten ver en la oscuridad."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Krokorok has specialized eyes that enable it to see in the dark. This ability lets Krokorok hunt in the dead of night without getting lost."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"暗闇でも 見える 特殊な 両目の おかげで 真夜中でも 迷わず 狩りが できるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Bien que ses yeux particuliers lui permettent de voir dans l’obscurité, les nuits sont si froides dans le désert qu’il ne se déplace presque pas."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Tiene unos ojos especiales que le permiten ver en la oscuridad, pero suele permanecer inmóvil en las frías noches del desierto."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Although this Pokémon has specialized eyes that allow it to see in the dark, Krokorok won’t move much at night—the desert gets cold after sunset."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"暗闇でも 見える 特殊な 両目を もつが 砂漠の夜は 寒いので あまり 動かない。"}],"varieties":[{"id":552,"moves":[{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"cut","learns":[[11,"machine",0],[14,"machine",0],[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"sand-attack","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",7],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",7],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",7],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",7],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",7],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",7],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"take-down","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thrash","learns":[[11,"level-up",52],[14,"level-up",52],[15,"level-up",52],[16,"level-up",52],[17,"level-up",52],[18,"level-up",52],[20,"level-up",47],[25,"level-up",47]]},{"name":"double-edge","learns":[[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"leer","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[25,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"bite","learns":[[11,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",4],[14,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",4],[15,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",4],[16,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",4],[17,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",4],[18,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",4],[20,"level-up",15],[2